Carafe Lab: bsd:u answers RecvMMsg and SendMMsg, which libnx uses for recvmsg and sendmsg; Eden left
them unimplemented, so every datagram read failed and a game polling a UDP socket until it is empty
never saw WSAEWOULDBLOCK. The messages are read and written in the layout libnx serialises them in.
GPL-3.0-or-later, as the file it changes.

